      "body": "Vishnu Chemicals Limited announced that at the board meeting held on May 22, 2026, recommended dividend of INR 0.30 per equity share of INR 2 each (i.e. 15%) for the financial year ended March 31, 2026 and the same shall be paid subject To Approve the shareholders at ensuing Annual General Meeting.",
