      "title": "Vishnu Chemicals Limited to Report Q4, 2026 Results on May 30, 2026",
      "body": "Vishnu Chemicals Limited announced that they will report Q4, 2026 results at 12:15 PM, Indian Standard Time on May 30, 2026",
      "keyDevTypeId": "55",
